{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 28, :comments ["<b>And they shall bind the breastpiece from its rings</b> — the lower ones — <b>to the rings</b> that are set in the skirt of the shoulder-pieces <b>of the efod</b> — behind the High Priest — <b>with a cord of tekhelet, so that</b> the lower edge of the breastpiece lies upon the band of the efod. <b>And it shall not slip</b> — it shall not move off; the letters, whose places of articulation interchange one with another, as he explained in the parashah of Kedoshim."], :book :exodus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 28, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:00:55.465621093Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}